[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14464.59, "timestamp": "04:01:04", "text": "营火。某人的椅子也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14469.15, "timestamp": "04:01:09", "text": "这里。这是什么？树干？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14472.63, "timestamp": "04:01:12", "text": "好吧，那我接下来要去哪儿呢？我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14478.229, "timestamp": "04:01:18", "text": "我知道镐子不应该能砍树。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14480.99, "timestamp": "04:01:20", "text": "好的，明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14484.63, "timestamp": "04:01:24", "text": "你。那么，X先生，您是如何找到我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14513.51, "timestamp": "04:01:53", "text": "我们主要在寻找石头，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14517.11, "timestamp": "04:01:57", "text": "可以制作斧头，这对我很有帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14518.429, "timestamp": "04:01:58", "text": "给你"}]